  "Artificial Intelligence for Robotics (2nd Edition)" by Packt Publishing
  (https://github.com/PacktPublishing/Artificial-Intelligence-for-Robotics-2e).
  Modified to match this project's dataset.

- xarm-yolo controller by Umair Cheema (cheemzgpt@gmail.com)
